# Reports stay gitignored so findings are not committed.
# Prove evidence under .helmsman/reports/prove/ stays ignored too.
# The harness is tracked under .helmsman/tools. The star ignores every
# other child of .helmsman, including reports. The tools exceptions are
# required: git will not descend into an ignored directory.
# node_modules/ stays after the tools exception. The last match wins,
# so a package install under the harness is not committed.
.helmsman/*
!.helmsman/setup.md
!.helmsman/tools/
!.helmsman/tools/**
node_modules/
.eslintcache
